# Why were these workers 'vulgar'? Caillebotte's The Floor Scrapers
tags: ["art history","realism","caillebotte","salon rejection","19th century paris","working class subjects"]
teaches: ["history/academic-salon-system","concepts/vulgarity-in-art","analysis/composition-and-perspective","history/impressionism"]
